    <label>Procurement Workspace Access</label>
    <!-- Object-level CRUD the Apex now enforces (Security.stripInaccessible /
         WITH USER_MODE). Account: Procurement onboards suppliers
         (onboardSupplierDirectly / submitAndScreen create the Account) and
         updates them — Create+Edit; Delete and View All stay with
         Full_Supplier_Visibility, which is the deliberate "see every
         supplier" grant. Audit_Log__c: Read only — all audit rows are
         written through AuditLogService in system context (see that
